{
  "version": 21,
  "variables": [],
  "tiles": {
    "0": {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## 📊 Calculator Business Health Dashboard\n\n**Real-time visibility** into the Calculator frontend availability, performance, and reliability metrics. This dashboard provides executive-level insights for Tier 2 critical application monitoring.\n\n---\n\n💰 **Business Impact of Downtime**\n\n| Metric | Impact |\n|--------|--------|\n| **Cost per minute** | $1,000 |\n| **NPS impact per incident** | -1 point |\n\n⚠️ *Every minute of downtime directly affects revenue and customer satisfaction.*"
    },
    "1": {
      "title": "Active problems (7d)",
      "type": "data",
      "query": "fetch dt.davis.problems, from: now()-7d\n| expand affected_entity_ids\n| filter affected_entity_ids == \"APPLICATION-D9224DBD5E818C72\" or affected_entity_ids == \"SYNTHETIC_TEST-5EC0C08020E249C7\" or affected_entity_ids == \"SYNTHETIC_TEST-4E92A5075C3A306C\"\n| filter event.status == \"ACTIVE\"\n| summarize count = countDistinct(display_id)",
      "visualization": "singleValue",
      "visualizationSettings": {
        "singleValue": {
          "label": "Active problems",
          "isIconVisible": true,
          "prefixIcon": "WarningIcon"
        },
        "autoSelectVisualization": false,
        "thresholds": [
          {
            "id": 1,
            "field": "count",
            "title": "",
            "isEnabled": true,
            "rules": [
              {
                "id": 0,
                "color": {
                  "Default": "var(--dt-colors-charts-status-ideal-default, #2f6862)"
                },
                "comparator": "≤",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": 1,
                "color": {
                  "Default": "var(--dt-colors-charts-apdex-fair-default, #a9780f)"
                },
                "comparator": "≤",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "id": 2,
                "color": {
                  "Default": "var(--dt-colors-charts-apdex-unacceptable-default, #cd3741)"
                },
                "comparator": "≤",
                "label": "",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "querySettings": {
        "maxResultRecords": 1000,
        "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
        "maxResultMegaBytes": 1,
        "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
        "enableSampling": false
      },
      "davis": {
        "enabled": false,
        "davisVisualization": { "isAvailable": true }
      }
    },
    "2": {
      "title": "Synthetic tests monitored",
      "type": "data",
