    "6": {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "**Operational guidance**\n- Active problems should be 0\n- Synthetic monitors should run every 60s\n- Investigate gaps in last run time\n- Confirm the detected URL matches production"
    },
    "7": {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "🎯 **Key Business Metrics**\n\n• **Problems**: Active incidents impacting users\n• **Availability**: % uptime (target: 99.95%)\n• **Error Budget**: Remaining downtime allowance\n• **MTTI**: Time to detect issues\n\n⚠️ **If RED**: Immediate escalation required"
    },
    "8": {
      "title": "Failure trend (problems) - 7d",
      "type": "data",
      "query": "fetch dt.davis.problems, from: now()-7d\n| expand affected_entity_ids\n| filter affected_entity_ids == \"APPLICATION-D9224DBD5E818C72\" or affected_entity_ids == \"SYNTHETIC_TEST-5EC0C08020E249C7\" or affected_entity_ids == \"SYNTHETIC_TEST-4E92A5075C3A306C\"\n| dedup display_id\n| makeTimeseries time:event.start, { problems = count() }",
      "visualization": "lineChart",
      "visualizationSettings": { "autoSelectVisualization": true },
      "querySettings": {
        "maxResultRecords": 1000,
        "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
        "maxResultMegaBytes": 2,
        "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
        "enableSampling": false
      },
      "davis": {
        "enabled": false,
        "davisVisualization": { "isAvailable": true }
